@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title End-to-End Integration Flow - Network Slice Provisioning

actor "Network Operator" as Op
participant "NLP Module" as NLP
participant "Claude Client" as Claude
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
participant "Nephio Generator" as Nephio
participant "VNF Operator" as VNF
participant "TN Agent" as TN
database "Kubernetes API" as K8s

== Intent Submission Phase ==
Op -> NLP: "Create video slice for 100Mbps,\n10ms latency, 99.9% reliability"
activate NLP
NLP -> NLP: tokenize and parse
NLP -> NLP: extract QoS parameters
NLP --> Claude: Parsed intent JSON\n{type: "video", bandwidth: 100,\nlatency: 10, reliability: 99.9}
deactivate NLP

== AI Analysis Phase ==
activate Claude
Claude -> Claude: validate intent
Claude -> Claude: analyze requirements
Claude -> Claude: recommend topology
Claude --> Orch: Placement request\n{cn_resources, tn_requirements}
deactivate Claude

== Orchestration Phase ==
activate Orch
Orch -> Orch: Calculate resources\n(CPU, memory, network)
Orch -> Orch: Select target cluster
Orch -> Orch: Optimize placement

par Core Network Provisioning
    Orch -> Nephio: Generate CN package\n{upf, smf, amf configs}
    activate Nephio
    Nephio -> Nephio: Load templates
    Nephio -> Nephio: Apply kpt functions
    Nephio -> Nephio: Render with kustomize
    Nephio -> K8s: Apply package\n(kubectl apply)
    activate K8s
    K8s -> K8s: Create namespace
    K8s -> K8s: Apply ConfigMaps
    K8s -> VNF: Deploy UPF pod
    activate VNF
    VNF -> K8s: Create Deployment
    K8s -> K8s: Schedule pod
    K8s --> VNF: Pod created
    VNF -> VNF: Initialize UPF
    VNF -> K8s: Update status: Running
    deactivate VNF
    K8s --> Nephio: Resources applied
    deactivate K8s
    Nephio --> Orch: CN deployment complete
    deactivate Nephio

else Transport Network Configuration
    Orch -> TN: Configure transport\n{vxlan_vni, endpoints, QoS}
    activate TN
    TN -> TN: Validate configuration
    TN -> TN: Create VXLAN tunnel\n(VNI: 1000)
    note right
        Optimized batch processing:
        - 10 operations/batch
        - 100ms batch window
    end note
    TN -> TN: Configure QoS policies
    TN -> TN: Setup traffic shaping
    TN -> K8s: Update TN status
    activate K8s
    K8s --> TN: Status updated
    deactivate K8s
    TN --> Orch: TN configuration complete
    deactivate TN
end

Orch -> Orch: Verify slice connectivity
Orch -> K8s: Query slice status
activate K8s
K8s --> Orch: All components healthy
deactivate K8s
Orch --> Op: Slice active and ready\n{slice_id, endpoints, monitoring_url}
deactivate Orch

== Monitoring Phase ==
Op -> K8s: Monitor slice health
activate K8s
K8s --> Op: Metrics and status
deactivate K8s

note over Op, K8s
    **End-to-End Provisioning Time:**
    - Intent parsing: ~500ms
    - AI analysis: ~1-2s
    - Resource orchestration: ~2-3s
    - CN deployment: ~30-60s
    - TN configuration: ~5-10s
    **Total: ~40-75 seconds**
end note

note over VNF, TN
    **Deployed Components:**
    - UPF (User Plane Function)
    - SMF (Session Management)
    - AMF (Access Management)
    - VXLAN tunnels
    - QoS policies
end note

@enduml